14l4|n|The stoke of a bell tolled at a funeral or at the death of a person; a death signal; a passing bell; hence, figuratively, a warning of, or a sound indicating, the passing away of anything. ; To sound as a knell; especially, to toll at a death or funeral; hence, to sound as a warning or evil omen.	n:hx6,141,3~hx6,141,3
